invalid type: string "Table Name: automatic_transactions\nBusiness Description: Automated bank transfer logs and payment gateway reference responses.\nPrimary Key: id\nDate Filtering Columns: created_at, updated_at\nAggregation Numerical Columns: amount\nCommon Join Conditions:\n  - automatic_transactions.user_id = users.id\n- withdrawal_request.automatic_transaction_id = automatic_transactions.id